# VMS-41R1 runner shell audit checklist

- [ ] Default command performs only zero-model preflight and writes no live/final/partial bundle.
- [ ] The runner derives exactly six case/attempt plans from `poc_vms_41r1.freeze.json`.
- [ ] Candidate-visible files exclude hidden acceptable sets, reference candidates, negative checks, thresholds and rubric.
- [ ] `--execute` fails closed with `LIVE_NOT_AUTHORIZED` until a future explicit permit exists.
- [ ] The runner imports no Devin launcher, subprocess, DB, Redis, network, Solver, or subagent surface.
- [ ] Preflight receipt preserves side-effect counts at zero and does not claim model/profile qualification.
